WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:25.295
Eddy rolled onto the school lot.

2
00:00:25.296 --> 00:00:29.976
His tires were new.

3
00:00:29.977 --> 00:00:33.640
His dumper was clean.

4
00:00:33.641 --> 00:00:36.990
"Oh boy!" said Eddy.

5
00:00:36.991 --> 00:00:39.841
"My first day of school!"

6
00:00:39.842 --> 00:00:42.739
Eddy looked at the big garage.

7
00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:47.174
A sign read Tire Town School.

8
00:00:47.175 --> 00:00:51.548
"Beep, beep!" said a long car.

9
00:00:51.549 --> 00:00:53.604
"You're in my way!"

10
00:00:53.605 --> 00:01:00.009
Eddy moved.

11
00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:02.793
Vroom! Vroom!

12
00:01:02.794 --> 00:01:05.755
"Look out!" said a fast car.

13
00:01:05.756 --> 00:01:08.067
Eddy jumped.

14
00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:11.935
"Move!" said a big truck.

15
00:01:11.936 --> 00:01:16.963
"Sorry!" said Eddy.

16
00:01:16.964 --> 00:01:20.048
Eddy parked near some tires.

17
00:01:20.049 --> 00:01:24.479
Fast cars and trucks zoomed by.

18
00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:31.298
Eddy sighed.

19
00:01:31.299 --> 00:01:35.268
"I wish I was fast," he thought.

20
00:01:35.269 --> 00:01:38.202
"Hello!" called a voice.

21
00:01:38.203 --> 00:01:41.036
Eddy turned around.

22
00:01:41.037 --> 00:01:44.334
He saw a funny car.

23
00:01:44.335 --> 00:01:47.971
She had bright colors.

24
00:01:47.972 --> 00:01:50.586
She had a big grin.

25
00:01:50.587 --> 00:01:54.085
"I'm Poppy," said the car.

26
00:01:54.086 --> 00:01:58.287
"Want to see something funny?"

